            "review_title": "Review at Little Bear",
            "review_text": "Tuyen Huynh\n9 contributions\n0\nLittle Bear SGN - Gastro Winebar\nMay 2024 • Friends\nJust spot this new place in the neighborhood - Thao Dien, D2, HCMC. Kinda surprised with this concept. I decided only to drink with my friends but they served me some really good free snacks. The food matches well with the wine I ordered although it’s looks so strange at first 😆 cant guess what it is. Space is not too loud but gives high energy, relaxing to talk. Will be back for sure!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nnice choice for gathering family and friends, pet friendly\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 5, 2024",
